  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat,\n\nI was wondering if you had any consideration to adding support to the Open Source VR Project to your game, as you already support Razer Hydra, VIVE, and Rift controllers, and 2 of their headsets. Open Source VR has both controllers and headsets available.\n\nI think it would be a nice feature to be able to use Open Source VR inside of VRChat, rather than the commercial options.",
